title: Re-export `WeightInfo` from the assets and vesting precompile crates
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `pallet-assets-precompiles` and `pallet-vesting-precompiles` now re-export their
    `WeightInfo` trait at the crate root like every other pallet, so weight files
    generated by `frame-omni-bencher`'s default template (`<crate>::WeightInfo`) compile
    without hand edits. Asset Hub Westend now uses generated weight files for both.
crates:
- name: pallet-assets-precompiles
  bump: minor
- name: pallet-vesting-precompiles
  bump: minor
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
